# pdx203 XNU patches, applied after the arch, SoC and OS series, one per line in application order.
# Carried from the pdx203 fork (UniXNU-prior, branch pdx203-bringup); the minimal format 2 image's set.
#
# Root authentication skipped under native-ufs-allow-unverified=1 (UniXNU-uke): APFS's FSIOC_KERNEL_ROOTAUTH needs a
# root hash iBoot and the SEP normally supply, and the signed owner-root policy is not built for this board.
zzzzzzz-offline-owner-root-auth-bypass.patch
# The CDC-ACM kernel log over the DWC3 (drivers/QcomXnuUsbDebug): the console tee and its worker thread.
zzzzzzzz-qcom-usb-debug-console.patch
zzzzzzzz-qcom-usb-debug-worker.patch
# sheng's launchd policy (package/BootWatchdogPolicy.c) without the boot progress layer.
zzzzzzzzza-launch-policy.patch
# pmap-ram-wc=1: RAM asked for as Device memory is mapped Normal non-cacheable.
zzzzzzzzzc-pmap-ram-wc.patch
# A stackshot fills no more wait/turnstile entries than it counted (a panic seen with eight CPUs).
zzzzzzzzzd-stackshot-bounds.patch
# Shutdown leaves the read-only root mounted.
zzzzzzzzze-skip-ro-root-unmount.patch
